OL,3,GNEWSAStorm drain 'a death trap', says
OL,4,ANoah Donohoe family solicitor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe culvert where 14-year-old Noah
OL,7,FDonohoe was found dead should be
OL,8,F"condemned as a death trap", according
OL,9,Fto Fiona Donohoe's solicitor Niall
OL,10,FMurphy.
OL,12,FOn Tuesday, the jury in the Noah
OL,13,FDonohoe inquest found it was possible,
OL,14,Fbut not probable, that failings by the
OL,15,FDepartment of Infrastructure (DfI) over
OL,16,Fthe tunnel in which he was found dead
OL,17,Fcontributed to his death.
OL,19,FThe jury found that the DfI had failed
OL,20,Fto identify a hazard at the site, which
OL,21,Fit maintains, and that there was no
OL,22,Fwarning sign.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
