OL,3,GNEWSAStorm drain 'a death trap', says
OL,4,ANoah Donohoe family solicitor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey also found numerous failings in
OL,7,Fthe Police Service of Northern
OL,8,FIreland's (PSNI's) investigation, but
OL,9,Fthat these did not contribute to the
OL,10,Fschoolboy's death.
